OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,8,     Frecordings including soprano
OL,9,     FCamilla Tilling and pianist Paul
OL,10,     FRivinius live from London's
OL,11,     FWigmore Hall.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Fela...
OL,13,     F...Sowande and the Art Music of
OL,14,     FNigeria. 1/5. Donald Macleod
OL,15,     Fexplores the roots of Nigerian art
OL,16,     Fmusic, from traditional tunes to
OL,17,     Fmissionary-led churches, with
OL,18,     FAlexander Douglas.
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FKatie welcomes Strahinja Mitrovic
OL,21,     Fand Imogen Whitehead to In Tune.
