OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical favourites
OL,8,     Ffrom Schumann, Sibelius and
OL,9,     FVaughan Williams.
OL,10,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     FChief Conductor Sofi Jeannin and
OL,12,     Fthe BBC Singers are joined by the
OL,13,     FAcademy of Ancient Music for
OL,14,     FBach's final choral masterpiece,
OL,15,     Fhis Mass in B minor.
OL,16,G2145 The Essay: Call of the Wild
OL,17,     FVerity Sharp talks to musician
OL,18,     FCosmo Sheldrake about his
OL,19,     Fcollaborations with whales.
