OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FMidori is the soloist in Dvorak's
OL,7,     FViolin Concerto with the German
OL,8,     FSymphony Orchestra, Berlin. The
OL,9,     Fprogramme features 'Earworms' by
OL,10,     FVivian Fung and Amy Beach's
OL,11,     F'Gaelic' Symphony.
